  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我有件事想请你帮个忙。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A621167094EF64E8B60F38BF74F605E2E4E2A5FD93002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这是我的一件私事，\n我和女儿说好了，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n会在她生日时送她某只宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F621176844E004EF679C14E8BFF0C000A6211548C5973513F8BF4597D4E86FF0C00100001BE00000A4F1A57285979751F65E565F69001597967D053EA5B9D53EF68A63002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要送给她的宝可梦\n将会是一只<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>谜拟丘<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898190017ED9597976845B9D53EF68A6000A5C064F1A662F4E0053EA00100002FF0000068C1C62DF4E1800100002FF0000003002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由于谜拟丘是夜行性宝可梦，\n要年幼的孩子来照顾它的话难度很高，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我也表达过可能还为时过早。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75314E8E8C1C62DF4E18662F591C884C60275B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A89815E745E7C76845B695B5067657167987E5B8376848BDD96BE5EA65F889AD8FF0C00100001BE00000A62114E5F88688FBE8FC753EF80FD8FD84E3A65F68FC765E93002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但如果我不送给她这只宝可梦，\n就必须得把发饰还给她。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F465982679C62114E0D90017ED959798FD953EA5B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A5C315FC5987B5F97628A53D199708FD87ED959793002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯，这个发饰可是\n我女儿送给我的礼物。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n听说是用咩利羊的体毛\n做的羊毛毡。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF0C8FD94E2A53D1997053EF662F000A62115973513F90017ED962117684793C7269300200100001BE01000A542C8BF4662F752854A952297F8A76844F536BDB000A505A76847F8A6BDB6BE13002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "现在对我来说，它已经是不可分割的一部分，\n所以我不能把它还给我女儿。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73B057285BF9621167658BF4FF0C5B835DF27ECF662F4E0D53EF5206527276844E0090E85206FF0C000A62404EE562114E0D80FD628A5B838FD87ED962115973513F3002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然卡洛斯地区\n没有谜拟丘……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但如果是在异次元密阿雷里面的话，\n或许就能遇到它。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713653616D1B65AF5730533A000A6CA167098C1C62DF4E182026202600100001BE01000A4F465982679C662F57285F026B2151435BC6963F96F791CC976276848BDDFF0C000A62168BB85C3180FD904752305B833002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "遇到时如果你能捉一只让给我的话，\n我会感激不尽的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9047523065F65982679C4F6080FD63494E0053EA8BA97ED9621176848BDDFF0C000A62114F1A611F6FC04E0D5C3D76843002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你愿意把谜拟丘让给我吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60613F610F628A8C1C62DF4E188BA97ED962115417FF1F001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "愿意！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "613F610FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很抱歉因为我的私事麻烦你，\n但请一定要把谜拟丘让给我！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F8862B16B4956E04E3A6211768479C14E8B9EBB70E64F60FF0C000A4F468BF74E005B9A8981628A8C1C62DF4E188BA97ED96211FF01001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我由衷地感谢你。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211753188775730611F8C224F603002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谜拟丘也拥有妖精属性，\n能借此克制龙属性。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C1C62DF4E184E5F62E5670959967CBE5C5E6027FF0C000A80FD501F6B64514B52369F995C5E60273002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说不定将来我女儿会成为训练家，\n并且打败我的老翁龙。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF44E0D5B9A5C06676562115973513F4F1A62104E3A8BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A5E764E1462538D256211768480017FC19F993002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "届时要如何应对，\n就看我这个当父亲的有多大能耐了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C4A65F6898159824F555E945BF9FF0C000A5C31770B62118FD94E2A5F5372364EB276846709591A592780FD80104E86FF01001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，包括这次的事在内，\n谢谢你总是不吝帮忙！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C530562EC8FD96B2176844E8B57285185FF0C000A8C228C224F60603B662F4E0D541D5E2E5FD9FF01001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    }
